WEBVTT

00:25:28.538 --> 00:25:33.246
You're going to go you're going to, you
know, go all the way to the finish line.

00:25:34.163 --> 00:25:41.913
In March of 1991, when your mom was 45,
you were 22, your mom died of cancer.

00:25:41.913 --> 00:25:47.246
And you've said that your mother's death
was in many ways your Genesis story

00:25:47.246 --> 00:25:50.746
and the start of what you
called your wild years.

00:25:50.746 --> 00:25:52.329
And you said that for you,

00:25:52.329 --> 00:25:55.121
using drugs or having a lot of sex

00:25:55.121 --> 00:25:59.788
or any sort of reckless behavior
was about love,